# Rendclaw Trow's persist (CR 702.79a): killed by Bot2's Lightning Bolt with no -1/-1 counter on it, it returns to the
# battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter, a 1/1 (the counter is checked). Killed by a second Bolt, now
# with a -1/-1 counter on it, it does not return: it stays in the graveyard.
# Bot1 casts the Trow on turn 1 (Black Lotus); Bot2 plays Mountain and Mox Ruby on turn 2 and casts both Bolts.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Rendclaw Trow
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Rendclaw Trow.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
